        "Content": "Beautifully presented one bed apartment with river views\r\nTop floor location (in that section of the building)\r\nAccessible via lift\r\nSecure designated parking\r\nUpgraded and tastefully refurbished over the years\r\nBalcony with river views\r\n10 foot high ceilings\r\nAttic storage\r\nEcoVolt energy efficient radiators\r\nLarge open communal gardens\r\nWell managed and maintained development\r\nEvery conceivable amenity within close proximity\r\nExcellent connectivity with multiple 24 hour bus routes nearby"
